    "date": "1969-07-20",
    "text": "Inside Mission Control, the call on the alarms fell to 26-year-old guidance officer Steve Bales, backed by computer specialist Jack Garman. They judged the alarms meant the guidance computer was overloaded but still doing its essential work, and told Flight Director Gene Kranz the landing could go on.",
